    "title": "Bibb deputies arrest 2 teens after rocks thrown from I-16 overpass - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Addison White ,\n5 hours ago MACON, Ga. (WGXA) — A thirteen- and fourteen-year-old male was charged with five counts of aggravated assault and four counts of Criminal Damage to Property. On Friday at around 10:00 p.m., Bibb County Sheriff's Office Patrol Deputies took two teenagers into custody, suspected of throwing rocks off an interstate overpass. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
